# Cursor Editor — MCP Integration

## Overview

The Model Context Protocol (MCP) provides a standardized way for Cursor to connect to external systems, tools, and data sources. MCP servers expose **tools** (actions the agent can perform) and **resources** (data the agent can read), creating a universal bridge between Cursor and the outside world.

```mermaid
